		switch random % 8:
			case 0:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 1500ms
				break
			case 1:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 2000ms
				break
			case 2:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 3000ms
				break
			case 3:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 1500ms
				break
			case 4:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 1800ms
				break
			case 5:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 1000ms
				break
			case 6:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 1500ms
				break
			default:
				Emote self 0mm 2000mm 38 39 250ms 2
				Sleep 1500ms
				break
	Return
